@startuml
!theme plain
title Smart Auto — Sequence: AI issue + Storage buckets (schema-aligned)

actor User
participant "Flutter app" as App
participant "Supabase Storage" as St
database "public.issues" as Iss
participant "AI API\n(e.g. Gemini)" as AI

User -> App: Submit photo / voice
App -> St: PUT **issue_images** /\n**voice_records**\npath {user_id}/...
St --> App: URL
App -> Iss: INSERT\n(image_url, voice_url, user_id)
Iss --> App: issue id

App -> AI: Run diagnosis
AI --> App: JSON result
App -> Iss: UPDATE **ai_response** (jsonb)
App --> User: Show result

note right of St
  Buckets from migration:\n**profile_images**, **issue_images**,\n**voice_records**, **chat_images**
end note

@enduml
